{"id":"JOUR368L","title":"Topics in Broadcast and Electronic Media; Introduction to Studio Production","department":"Journalism","level":"Undergrad","credits":"3","description":"Prerequisite: JOUR262/JOUR347 or permission of instructor - nsteven5@umd.\n\nThis course will take you through every production aspect related to studio production. This includes learning how to plan and execute a live studio production featuring camera crews, a floor director, producer, director, technical director, audio, and teleprompter. Labs will focus on putting together and executing a live newscast production. Students will also be able to go on live shots with reporters to run camera/lighting.","gradingMethods":null,"noLongerOffered":false,"removedTerm":null,"removedDetected":null,"terms":[{"term":"202001","sections":1,"seats":3,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Jennifer Beemsterboer"],"removed":false},{"term":"202008","sections":1,"seats":8,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Jennifer Beemsterboer"],"removed":false},{"term":"202208","sections":2,"seats":10,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Nathaniel Stevens"],"removed":false},{"term":"202301","sections":1,"seats":10,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Nathaniel Stevens"],"removed":false},{"term":"202308","sections":1,"seats":10,"openSeats":1,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Nathaniel Stevens"],"removed":false},{"term":"202401","sections":1,"seats":10,"openSeats":2,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Nathaniel Stevens"],"removed":false},{"term":"202408","sections":1,"seats":10,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Nathaniel Stevens"],"removed":false},{"term":"202501","sections":1,"seats":10,"openSeats":0,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Nathaniel Stevens"],"removed":false},{"term":"202508","sections":1,"seats":10,"openSeats":8,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Nathaniel Stevens"],"removed":false},{"term":"202601","sections":1,"seats":10,"openSeats":10,"waitlist":0,"instructors":["Nathaniel Stevens"],"removed":false}